# OpenTofu and Terraform working state, which `tofu init` writes into a
# fixture directory when checklist-dev-tofu's validate hook runs there. The
# provider binaries alone are tens of megabytes, and the lock file pins
# provider hashes that go stale, so neither belongs in the repository.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
